loading_tips = PackedStringArray("Mall Walkers pump their arms before a power-walk burst. They steer slowly while they charge: sidestep!", "Food Court Flingers wind up a soda before they lob it. A headshot mid-windup spills it.", "The escalators lead to the balcony ring: high ground with a view over the whole court.", "The west escalator is out of order, but you can still climb it.", "When the power cuts out, only the moonlight through the dome and the red emergency lights are left. Listen for footsteps.", "The Night Manager power-walks straight at you. Step out of the line and punish the recovery.")
